<title>NORWAY: TENNIS-NORWAY LEAD NIGERIA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NORWAY LEAD NIGERIA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway took a 2-0 lead over Nigeria</p>
<p>in their Davis Cup tennis Euro/African zone group two first</p>
<p>round tie on Friday:</p>
<p>Results (Norwegian names first):</p>
<p>Jan Frode Andersen beat Sule Lavito 6-1 6-0 6-4</p>
<p>Christian Ruud  beat Ganiyu Adelekan 6-0 6-1 6-0</p>
</text>
